NAME
       startgui - start the graphical session

SYNOPSIS
       startgui

DESCRIPTION
       startgui asks the kernel to start the desktop and the graphical login
       on virtual console 7 and switches the screen there. If the session is
       already running it only switches to it. Only root may run it; init(8)
       runs it at boot unless the kernel command line contains text.

SEE ALSO
       init(8), chvt(1)
